      "text": "[11:07AM] #LagIbdExpWay\n#3MB\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nWe are currently experiencing rapid Vehicular movement from Berger en route Tollgate.\nTraffic moves slowly from the Emergency centre inward Tollgate/7up due to bus stop activities.\nMoving ahead to Alapere is better but bus stop activities slow down movement approaching Ogudu as well.\n\nOgudu to Iyana Oworo is better and the entire Third mainland bridge is also free.\n\nDo not overspeed, it kills!\n#FollowLASTMA\n@Sola_Giwa \n@OlalekanOki \n@TrafficChiefNG \n@lagostraffic961",
